Description: SoftglowOS desktop, branding and audio configuration
 The SoftglowOS look on plain GNOME instead of Ubuntu's (dock, top bar,
 extensions, fonts, wallpapers, boot splash, login logo) and the PipeWire
 and WirePlumber configuration behind the Hub's mixer.
